      "<b>ragkit.hybrid.HybridRetriever:</b> <code>HybridRetriever({\"bm25\": bm25, \"dense\": dense}, method=\"rrf\" | \"weighted\", fetch_k=50)</code>. כל Hit נושא <code>bm25</code>, <code>vector</code>, <code>rank:bm25</code>, <code>rank:dense</code> ו-<code>rrf</code>. הוא גם Index, עם add ו-remove.",
